  "limitations": [
    "Distinct reconstruction of the completed Atlantic Bridge exterior, based on three pictures from one contractor project page and the standard viewer map/terrain sources. Construction cranes, temporary platforms, workers, ships and temporary barriers are excluded.",
    "Published530m main span,1050m cable-stayed unit,212.5m pylons,75m navigation clearance,2.8m girders and approximate8m stay rhythm govern the exterior. The modeled3140m extent follows the retained full bridge envelope with short end caps; the older2820m catalog length is not forced onto the mapped approaches. Project heights are used as approximate sea-level visualization datums, not engineering elevation certificates.",
    "The current PMTiles canal intervalX-305..155m places the main-span center atX-75m. Paired pylons are atX-340/190m, not symmetrically centered on the catalog anchor. Pylon leg taper, anchorage dimensions, local girder section, viaduct pier rhythm and road furniture are picture-based reconstructions. The number/spacing of the regularized approach piers is not an as-built inventory.",
    "Deck profile uses standard Mapzen/AWS terrain samples:33.5m west/11.5m east ends,50.5m over the western approach rise,77.8m main deck. A2.8m girder gives75m main-span underside clearance. Native terrain is coarse; exact abutments, foundations, bank retaining structures and grade-break curvature remain approximate. No bespoke terrain or cadastral research.",
    "Concrete, coated metal, stainless stay cables and aggregate road surfacing use existing shared graphs with metric UVs; gravel approximates asphalt. Paint uses a local palette. No private or embedded texture images. Close-up and master retain cable sheaths/anchor blocks, road marks, twin-arm median lighting and deck diaphragms. Skyline uses broad double-sided cable ribbons; sparse district/street cables aggregate the full pair of fans. Thin road furniture is omitted at distance. Estimated LOD error values8/4/2/1m are not certified whole-mesh distances. Physical ordinary-laptop and phone measurements remain pending. Skyline aggregates paired approach stems into broad single-pier proxies and twelve curved deck sections; district restores the twin-column viaducts."
  ],
